What this repository REFERENCES but does NOT bundle
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The manifests under `lts/` record the versions of ComfyUI, custom nodes and models
that make up an LTS line. **The referenced software itself is NOT contained in this
repository.** A manifest only points at a version; the actual code and weights are
fetched from their original distributors.

Each manifest entry records the license of what it points at. In summary:

  ComfyUI (comfyanonymous/ComfyUI)   GPL-3.0
  Custom nodes (10)                  Apache-2.0 / MIT / GPL-3.0 (see the manifest)
  Model sources (8)                  Apache-2.0 / MIT / FAIPL-1.0-SD and others

**If you fetch and run the versions recorded here, you must comply with the license
of each distributor.** The Apache-2.0 license of this repository applies only to the
manifests and the tools in this repository, and does not extend to the referenced
software.
